    "ornament": "Op-art colour stripes and kinetic art in public buildings (Cruz-Diez, Otero), Villanueva-style concrete screens, brise-soleil and ceramic or mosaic murals; exposed-brick and breeze-block walls with rebar stubs on barrio houses; colonial arched portals and iron-grilled windows; bright street murals; perimeter security bars and razor-wire walls.",
